Purpose: M0 spike of P4. Bind an extension copy to one userContextId via the pref
swell.spike.boundUserContext.<id>, and enforce it for content scripts, tabs, cookies,
webRequest and the background page's own requests. swell.spike.originalId.<id> maps a
derived ID back to the original for native messaging.
Test: ./mach test swell/tests/isolation/browser/browser_isolation_extensions.js --headless
Prototype only: replace with the real P4 patch series in M2.

